Place OS installation images here. Supported formats:

  - ISO images (.iso) — mounted and served via HTTP for PXE/iPXE boot
  - Kernel + initrd pairs — for direct network boot
  - Tarballs (.tar.gz) — extracted and served

Register images with: vigocli sandgorgon images register <path>

Sandgorgon does not ship OS images. Populate this directory with your
organization's approved images and register them for provisioning.
